<PICTURE><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1417942636" ZOrder="14" NumberingType="Figure" TextWrap="BehindText" Lock="false"><SIZE Width="5668" Height="5668" WidthRelTo="Absolute" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false"/><POSITION TreatAsChar="false" VertRelTo="Para" HorzRelTo="Column" VertAlign="Top" HorzAlign="Left" VertOffset="-902" HorzOffset="45188" FlowWithText="false" AllowOverlap="true"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Left="0" Right="0" Top="0" Bottom="0"/></SHAPEOBJECT><SHAPECOMPONENT XPos="-3384" YPos="-2576" GroupLevel="0" OriWidth="10208" OriHeight="12300" CurWidth="8161" CurHeight="9823" HorzFlip="false" VertFlip="false"><ROTATIONINFO Angle="0" CenterX="2834" CenterY="2834"/><RENDERINGINFO><TRANSMATRIX E1="1.00" E2="0.00" E3="-3384.00" E4="0.00" E5="1.00" E6="-2576.00"/><SCAMATRIX E1="0.80" E2="0.00" E3="-166.03" E4="0.00" E5="0.80" E6="2941.45"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00" E2="0.00" E3="0.00" E4="0.00" E5="1.00" E6="0.00"/><SCAMATRIX E1="0.82" E2="0.00" E3="-17.00" E4="0.00" E5="0.79" E6="0.00"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.21" E2="0.00" E3="-927.59" E4="0.00" E5="1.45" E6="227.53"/><SCAMATRIX E1="0.70" E2="0.00" E3="5430.00" E4="0.00" E5="0.73" E6="-584.00"/><ROTMATRIX E1="1.00" E2="0.00" E3="0.00" E4="0.00" E5="0.69" E6="-195.65"/></RENDERINGINFO></SHAPECOMPONENT><LINESHAPE Color="11866128" Width="85" Style="Solid" EndCap="Round" OutlineStyle="Outer"/><IMAGERECT X0="0" Y0="0" X1="10208" Y1="0" X2="10208" Y2="12300" X3="0" Y3="12300"/><IMAGECLIP Left="1417" Top="1417" Right="13583" Bottom="13583"/><INSIDEMARGIN Left="0" Right="0" Top="0" Bottom="0"/><IMAGE Bright="0" Contrast="0" Effect="RealPic" BinItem="8"/></PICTURE><FIELDBEGIN Type="Bookmark" Name="지방세기본법" InstId="1526823554" Editable="false" Dirty="false" Property="2"/><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="57"><TEXT CharShape="83"><CHAR>※ 본 법령은 공포 후 시행전 개정된 사항을 모두 포함한 법령이며, 개별 시행일별로 공포된</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="84"><CHAR> 내용은 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="57"><TEXT CharShape="84"><CHAR>국가법령정보센터의 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="83"><CHAR>'연혁' 또는 조문 앞의 '연' 아이콘을 통해 확인할 수 있습니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="2"><TEXT CharShape="6"></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="74"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>지방세기본법</CHAR><FIELDEND Type="Bookmark" Editable="false" Property="2"/></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR></CHAR></TEXT></P>
